OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after
OL,4,A21-year-old stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old has died after he was
OL,7,Fstabbed in north London.
OL,9,FThe Met Police said emergency services
OL,10,Fwere called to Lordship Lane in
OL,11,FHaringey just after 18:00 GMT on Friday
OL,12,Fto reports of a man being attacked.
OL,13,FDespite efforts of paramedics, he was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FThe man has been named as Thomas Oduro
OL,17,Ffrom Tottenham. His next-of-kin have
OL,18,Fbeen informed and a murder
OL,19,Finvestigation has been launched.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
