OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after
OL,4,A21-year-old stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Phil Clarke, who is leading
OL,7,Fthe investigation, said: "Thomas's
OL,8,Ffamily have suffered a devastating
OL,9,Floss. Our thoughts are with them, and
OL,10,Fthey continue to be supported by
OL,11,Fspecialist officers."
